.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T14:04:02.571456+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2369,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T13:43:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T15:37:15.989140+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T13:57:21.866510+00:00","content_hash":"cbfe8a8f2ee424afede770269f067b622d62b0572782456800053ad1adb3eb62","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}